<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-28" title="Influencer requirements" summary="Influencer banne se pehle yeh zaroori shartein padhein." review={true} related={[{ href: '/hosts/rules', label: 'Influencer rules' }, { href: '/hosts/agreement', label: 'Influencer agreement' }]}>
<h2>Who can join as an influencer?</h2><ul><li>You must be at least 18 and an Indian resident.</li><li>Use your own phone number and one account per person.</li><li>Only you may take calls on your account. Do not share or rent it.</li><li>You become an influencer in our app. Pick your categories, then record a short live video (10 to 20 seconds, phone held upright, no uploads) saying what fans can call you about. A person from our team checks it and approves you before you go live.</li><li>Social media verification is optional: log in with YouTube, Instagram or Facebook to show the account is yours.</li><li>No social media account? Verify with Aadhaar instead. Aadhaar is also needed if you pick Listener, Prayer, Virtual friend or Women-to-Women.</li><li>A Women-to-Women channel needs an Aadhaar that shows female. LGBTQ+ channels that already exist stay as they are.</li><li>You choose how you take calls: Bookings only, or Bookings + live.</li><li>You can choose to take calls only from video-KYC customers. It is free for every creator. We never share any customer&rsquo;s details with anyone.</li><li>We check your UPI once, before your first withdrawal.</li></ul>
<h2>Conversation, without professional claims</h2><p>Do not present yourself on {BRAND.name} as a doctor, lawyer, counsellor, chartered accountant or financial advisor. Do not give medical, legal, financial or other regulated advice, even if you hold a qualification outside the platform.</p>
<p>Give honest profile details. Keep your account details up to date.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
